# Interactive States

This document tests handrail visibility, hover, focus, and collapse states.

This is a regular paragraph. Its handrail should be hidden by default.

## Visible Handrails

:theorem:

  This theorem has a visible handrail.

::

:definition:

  Visible handrails are not hidden by default.

::

## Collapsible Content

:theorem:

  This theorem contains a collapsible proof.

::

:proof:

  This proof can be collapsed and expanded using the collapse button.

  It contains multiple paragraphs to make the collapse behavior more visible.

  When collapsed, the content should be hidden and the collapse indicator should show.

::

